msgid "What&#8217;s new?"
msgstr ""

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Just a week after 1.9.1.Final, here comes 1.9.2.Final with some bugfixes and documentation improvements.\n"
"Thanks a lot to everyone providing feedback and pull requests!"
msgstr "在 1.9.1.Final 发布一周后，1.9.2.Final 又发布了，其中包括一些错误修复和文档改进。非常感谢大家提供反馈和拉取请求！"

#, fuzzy
msgid "It is a safe upgrade for everyone using Quarkus 1.9."
msgstr "对于使用Quarkus 1.9的所有人来说，这是一次安全的升级。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "If you are not using 1.9 already, please refer to the https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-1.9[1.9 migration guide]."
msgstr "如果你还没有使用1.9，请参考 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/wiki/Migration-Guide-1.9[1.9迁移指南] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "This release is a maintenance release."
msgstr "这个版本是一个维护版本。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "You can get https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.9.2.Final[the full changelog of 1.9.2.Final on GitHub]."
msgstr "你可以 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.9.2.Final[在GitHub上] 获得 link:https://github.com/quarkusio/quarkus/releases/tag/1.9.2.Final[1.9.2.Final的完整更新日志] 。"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Come Join Us"
msgstr "快来加入我们吧"

#, fuzzy
msgid "We value your feedback a lot so please report bugs, ask for improvements... Let's build something great together!"
msgstr "我们非常重视您的反馈，因此请随时报告 bug、提出改进建议……​让我们一起打造出精彩的作品吧！"

#, fuzzy
